    Content: Annex B (pages 9 to 19 of the document), the example of the key exchange protocol; Annex C
    (pages 20 to 23), the example of the key encapsulation mechanism; Annex D (pages 24 to 30), the example
    of public key encryption; each as the text layer of the PDF gives it (extracted with pypdf 5.4.0);
    characters the text layer does not map are shown as "?", and nothing else is changed.
    Note: in the steps A1 and B1 of annex B the document prints IDB || hid and IDA || hid with hid = 02
    ("426F6202", "416C6963 6502"), but the values of H1 printed after them, and the keys, are those of
    hid = 03, the identifier of the encryption keys given at the start of the annex; the tests use 03.
    Used: the keys, the intermediate values and the results of the key exchange of Alice and Bob
    (annex B), of the encapsulation for Bob (annex C) and of the encryption of "Chinese IBE standard" for
    Bob with the stream cipher and with SM4 in CBC mode (annex D) (tests/crypto/sm9.rs).
